{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Erstelle eine neue responsive Text-und-Icon-Grid-Section für meine About-us-Seite.
    
    Die komplette Section muss innerhalb eines zentrierten Content-Containers mit maximal 1500 px Breite liegen. Verwende width: 100%, max-width: 1500px, margin: 0 auto und box-sizing: border-box. Die Section muss dadurch exakt dieselbe Breite und Außenkante wie meine anderen 1500-px-Sections haben.
    
    Desktop: Zweispaltiges Layout. Links befindet sich ein Textbereich mit kleiner Eyebrow, großer Überschrift und Fließtext. Rechts befindet sich ein 2-spaltiges Icon-Raster mit bis zu 6 frei hinzufügbaren Icon-Blöcken. Jeder Block enthält ein frei auswählbares/hochladbares Icon und eine frei bearbeitbare Bezeichnung darunter.
    
    Das Icon-Raster hat keine Karten und keinen äußeren Rahmen. Zwischen den beiden Spalten befindet sich nur eine feine vertikale Trennlinie und zwischen den Reihen feine horizontale Trennlinien.
    
    Mobile: Text oben, Icon-Raster darunter. Das Icon-Raster bleibt 2-spaltig. Alles muss vollständig responsiv sein und exakt denselben seitlichen Abstand verwenden.
    
    Im Shopify-Editor möchte ich alles einstellen können: Section-Breite (Standard 1500 px), Section-Höhe/Mindesthöhe, Seitenabstand Desktop und Mobile, Padding oben/unten, Verhältnis Text/Icon-Spalte, Spaltenabstand, Eyebrow-Größe, Überschriftgröße Desktop/Mobile, Textgröße Desktop/Mobile, Icon-Größe Desktop/Mobile, Abstände, Hintergrundfarbe, sämtliche Textfarben sowie Farbe und Stärke der Trennlinien.
    
    Die bis zu 6 Icons müssen als einzelne Shopify-Blöcke angelegt werden, damit ich Icon und Text jedes Elements individuell ändern, hinzufügen, entfernen und sortieren kann.
    
    Wichtig: Keine 100vw-Breite und keine zusätzlichen äußeren Wrapper, die den Inhalt über 1500 px hinaus vergrößern. Hintergrund darf Full-Width sein, der sichtbare Content jedoch maximal 1500 px. Keine Buttons, Schatten oder zusätzlichen Designelemente., Überarbeite ausschließlich das Design des Icon-Rasters.
    
    Aktuell sieht es wie eine vollständig eingerahmte 2×3-Tabelle aus. Das möchte ich nicht.
    
    Entferne komplett die äußere Umrandung des Icon-Rasters. Es sollen ausschließlich dezente innere Trennlinien vorhanden sein:
    
    eine vertikale Linie zwischen den beiden Spalten
    zwei horizontale Linien zwischen den drei Reihen
    keine Linie oben, unten, links oder rechts außen
    
    Die einzelnen Bereiche sollen kompakter und hochwertiger wirken. Reduziere die Höhe der einzelnen Reihen und den übermäßigen Leerraum.
    
    Jedes Element besteht aus einem größeren, frei auswählbaren Icon oben und einer zentrierten Überschrift direkt darunter. Icon und Text müssen innerhalb ihres Bereichs horizontal und vertikal sauber zentriert sein.
    
    Die Icons sollen deutlich größer als aktuell dargestellt werden. Icon-Größe, Zeilenhöhe, Abstand zwischen Icon und Überschrift sowie Padding der einzelnen Rasterelemente müssen im Shopify-Editor einstellbar sein.
    
    Auch Farbe und Stärke der inneren Trennlinien müssen einstellbar sein.
    
    Das Raster soll weiterhin bis zu 6 frei hinzufügbare Shopify-Blöcke unterstützen.
    
    Desktop: 2 Spalten × bis zu 3 Reihen.
    
    Mobile: ebenfalls 2 Spalten, aber mit kleineren Icons, reduzierten Abständen und responsiver Höhe.
    
    Wichtig: Das Raster darf nicht wie sechs Karten oder eine Tabelle aussehen. Es soll offen, minimalistisch und leicht wirken – die Trennlinien dienen lediglich zur visuellen Strukturierung.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}
{% style %}
.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}{display:block;width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;background:{{block.settings.background_color}}}.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__container{width:100%;max-width:{{block.settings.section_width}}px;min-height:{{block.settings.min_height}}px;margin:0 auto;padding:{{block.settings.padding_vertical}}px {{block.settings.desktop_side_padding}}px;box-sizing:border-box;display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,{{block.settings.text_column_ratio}}fr) minmax(0,{{block.settings.icon_column_ratio}}fr);gap:{{block.settings.column_gap}}px;align-items:center}.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__eyebrow,.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__heading,.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__body,.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__label{font-family:{{block.settings.body_font.family}}}.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__eyebrow{margin:0 0 {{block.settings.eyebrow_spacing}}px;color:{{block.settings.eyebrow_color}};font-size:{{block.settings.eyebrow_size}}px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase}.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__heading{margin:0 0 {{block.settings.heading_spacing}}px;color:{{block.settings.heading_color}};font-family:{{block.settings.heading_font.family}};font-size:{{block.settings.heading_size_desktop}}px;line-height:1.1}.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__body{color:{{block.settings.body_text_color}};font-size:{{block.settings.body_size_desktop}}px;line-height:1.6}.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__body p{margin:0 0 1em}.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));align-self:center}.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__item{min-height:{{block.settings.item_min_height}}px;padding:{{block.settings.item_padding}}px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;box-sizing:border-box}.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__item:nth-child(odd){border-right:{{block.settings.divider_thickness}}px solid {{block.settings.divider_color}}}.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__item:nth-child(-n+4){border-bottom:{{block.settings.divider_thickness}}px solid {{block.settings.divider_color}}}.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__icon,.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__placeholder{width:{{block.settings.icon_size_desktop}}px;height:{{block.settings.icon_size_desktop}}px;margin-bottom:{{block.settings.icon_spacing}}px;object-fit:contain;color:{{block.settings.icon_color}}}.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__placeholder svg{width:100%;height:100%}.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__label{margin:0;color:{{block.settings.icon_text_color}};font-size:{{block.settings.icon_text_size}}px;line-height:1.35}@media(max-width:749px){.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__container{min-height:{{block.settings.mobile_min_height}}px;padding:{{block.settings.mobile_padding_vertical}}px {{block.settings.mobile_side_padding}}px;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:{{block.settings.mobile_content_gap}}px}.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__heading{font-size:{{block.settings.heading_size_mobile}}px}.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__body{font-size:{{block.settings.body_size_mobile}}px}.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__icon,.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__placeholder{width:{{block.settings.icon_size_mobile}}px;height:{{block.settings.icon_size_mobile}}px}.ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__item{min-height:{{block.settings.mobile_item_min_height}}px;padding:{{block.settings.mobile_item_padding}}px}}
{% endstyle %}
<div class="ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}" {{block.shopify_attributes}}><div class="ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__container"><div>{% if block.settings.eyebrow != blank %}<p class="ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__eyebrow">{{block.settings.eyebrow|escape}}</p>{% endif %}<h2 class="ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__heading">{{block.settings.heading|escape}}</h2><div class="ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__body">{{block.settings.body}}</div></div><div class="ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__grid">{% for i in (1..6) %}{% assign icon_key='icon_'|append:i %}{% assign label_key='label_'|append:i %}{% assign icon=block.settings[icon_key] %}{% assign label=block.settings[label_key] %}{% if icon != blank or label != blank %}<div class="ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__item">{% if icon %}<img class="ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__icon" src="{{icon|image_url:width:320}}" alt="{{label|escape}}" loading="lazy">{% else %}<div class="ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__placeholder">{{'image'|placeholder_svg_tag}}</div>{% endif %}<p class="ai-text-icon-grid-{{ai_gen_id}}__label">{{label|escape}}</p></div>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div></div></div>
{% schema %}{"name":"Text and icon grid","settings":[{"type":"text","id":"eyebrow","label":"Eyebrow","default":"Über uns"},{"type":"text","id":"heading","label":"Heading","default":"Kompetenz, der Sie vertrauen können"},{"type":"richtext","id":"body","label":"Text","default":"<p>Wir verbinden medizinische Expertise mit zuverlässigen Produkten und persönlicher Beratung.</p>"},{"type":"range","id":"section_width","label":"Section width","min":1000,"max":1800,"step":50,"unit":"px","default":1500},{"type":"range","id":"min_height","label":"Minimum height","min":300,"max":1000,"step":50,"unit":"px","default":500},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_min_height","label":"Mobile minimum height","min":300,"max":1000,"step":50,"unit":"px","default":500},{"type":"range","id":"desktop_side_padding","label":"Desktop side padding","min":0,"max":120,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":40},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_side_padding","label":"Mobile side padding","min":0,"max":60,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":20},{"type":"range","id":"padding_vertical","label":"Desktop vertical padding","min":0,"max":160,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":80},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_padding_vertical","label":"Mobile vertical padding","min":0,"max":120,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":50},{"type":"range","id":"text_column_ratio","label":"Text column ratio","min":1,"max":4,"step":1,"default":2},{"type":"range","id":"icon_column_ratio","label":"Icon column ratio","min":1,"max":4,"step":1,"default":3},{"type":"range","id":"column_gap","label":"Column gap","min":20,"max":160,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":80},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_content_gap","label":"Mobile content gap","min":20,"max":100,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":50},{"type":"font_picker","id":"heading_font","label":"Heading font","default":"poppins_n4"},{"type":"font_picker","id":"body_font","label":"Body font","default":"manrope_n4"},{"type":"range","id":"eyebrow_size","label":"Eyebrow size","min":10,"max":24,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":13},{"type":"range","id":"heading_size_desktop","label":"Desktop heading size","min":28,"max":80,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":52},{"type":"range","id":"heading_size_mobile","label":"Mobile heading size","min":24,"max":54,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":34},{"type":"range","id":"body_size_desktop","label":"Desktop text size","min":14,"max":24,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":17},{"type":"range","id":"body_size_mobile","label":"Mobile text size","min":14,"max":22,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":16},{"type":"range","id":"eyebrow_spacing","label":"Eyebrow spacing","min":4,"max":40,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":14},{"type":"range","id":"heading_spacing","label":"Heading spacing","min":8,"max":50,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":22},{"type":"range","id":"item_min_height","label":"Desktop row height","min":80,"max":260,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":140},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_item_min_height","label":"Mobile row height","min":70,"max":220,"step":10,"unit":"px","default":110},{"type":"range","id":"item_padding","label":"Desktop item padding","min":8,"max":50,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":16},{"type":"range","id":"mobile_item_padding","label":"Mobile item padding","min":6,"max":36,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":10},{"type":"range","id":"icon_size_desktop","label":"Desktop icon size","min":40,"max":140,"step":5,"unit":"px","default":80},{"type":"range","id":"icon_size_mobile","label":"Mobile icon size","min":28,"max":100,"step":4,"unit":"px","default":52},{"type":"range","id":"icon_spacing","label":"Icon and label gap","min":4,"max":30,"step":2,"unit":"px","default":10},{"type":"range","id":"icon_text_size","label":"Icon label size","min":12,"max":24,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":15},{"type":"range","id":"divider_thickness","label":"Divider thickness","min":1,"max":4,"step":1,"unit":"px","default":1},{"type":"color","id":"background_color","label":"Background","default":"#ffffff"},{"type":"color","id":"eyebrow_color","label":"Eyebrow color","default":"#1d2e40"},{"type":"color","id":"heading_color","label":"Heading color","default":"#1d2e40"},{"type":"color","id":"body_text_color","label":"Body text color","default":"#1d2e40"},{"type":"color","id":"icon_text_color","label":"Icon label color","default":"#1d2e40"},{"type":"color","id":"icon_color","label":"Placeholder icon color","default":"#1d2e40"},{"type":"color","id":"divider_color","label":"Divider color","default":"#b8c2c9"},{"type":"header","content":"Icons"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"icon_1","label":"Icon 1"},{"type":"text","id":"label_1","label":"Label 1","default":"Your benefit"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"icon_2","label":"Icon 2"},{"type":"text","id":"label_2","label":"Label 2","default":"Your benefit"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"icon_3","label":"Icon 3"},{"type":"text","id":"label_3","label":"Label 3","default":"Your benefit"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"icon_4","label":"Icon 4"},{"type":"text","id":"label_4","label":"Label 4","default":"Your benefit"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"icon_5","label":"Icon 5"},{"type":"text","id":"label_5","label":"Label 5","default":"Your benefit"},{"type":"image_picker","id":"icon_6","label":"Icon 6"},{"type":"text","id":"label_6","label":"Label 6","default":"Your benefit"}],"presets":[{"name":"Text and icon grid"}],"tag":null,"class":"text-icon-grid-block"}{% endschema %}